{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10010_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:89d1924816bb84e9e4ae224d590fd9d018b828e7dfc09bf90692e92fc91e983c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f823049658abcfe6aeed68265aed2cc29781de8803d7103895839f7ff38b5a0e",
      "text": "今天多谢大家到场！\n你们也喜欢摩托吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02aa236be594f6d7d5be319e826b5cb3cc56e63a7437940e91841e31d6d8abb0",
      "text": "其实我也非常憧憬摩托车。\n每个月都很期待这本杂志呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00fb1b72ac59cf57f610eb835d34c142b0caa4ccd465f9cb7dbd9ac65ac8c8d6",
      "text": "我可是期期不落全买了哦！\n这个月的封面也超级帅气对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b35c14367359941fcdfdedf113c3939e24b391ae7849df8b5a373b97b7b8225",
      "text": "买了最新一期杂志去到事务所，\n正好就来了这个工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d3e255f99e2c2192c34eee5bef69e6c919566b30642ce7280dc48cf6ba1066",
      "text": "哈哈，又说起同一件事了。\n虽然我也很期待，但搭档的高兴劲儿尤为特别啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fa80978f2566689c49efcf42ac876287ca2ef341281a254767d7776bf05461d",
      "text": "嘿嘿……因为，真的超开心的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86c160dc0e7e97898620a2fe13101b89dc8d79a96c7359ebf300f9fb8d5cc451",
      "text": "总之，今天的我\n干劲超群啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31707804db6874d321708f76cc1d013c548bcf9e950cb9a385b4068a19b77c4c",
      "text": "倾注我们宛如烈火燃烧般的心意吧。\n你们也让我们听听最炽热的呐喊声啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca65bf2c00c28fbba3621b881601766c804caa2f9826a0eb6c398a59b183a436",
      "text": "上啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
